                    Distribution. Repeated to London, Paris, and Moscow.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d8-f2" n="2" xml:id="d8-f2-content">
                <p>Telegram 1948, March 7, not printed. (<hi rendition="#italic">Ibid</hi>.) For text of the Austrian memorandum, delivered to
                        Molotov on March 14, see <hi
